<title>JAPAN: MIROKU JYOHO TO LIST SHARES ON TSE 2ND SECTION.</title>
<headline>MIROKU JYOHO TO LIST SHARES ON TSE 2ND SECTION.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Friday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list Miroku Jyoho Service Co Ltd on the second section of the exchange.</p>
<p>Miroku Jyoho is likely to be listed on August 28 and it plans to offer 1.5 million new shares through a secondary offering, the TSE said.</p>
<p>Miroku Jyoho, now traded on the over-the-counter (OTC) market, is a developer of accounting software.</p>
</text>
